steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
      seconds: 1782826549
      nanos: 1538443
    }
    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Design and develop a world-class, production-ready, mobile-first, highly interactive official website for TECHCON \'26, a premium technology conference organized by msf TechFed.\n\nThis is NOT a template website, landing page, startup page, SaaS page, or generic conference website. It must feel like the official digital identity of an international flagship technology conference.\n\nThe quality should rival websites such as Apple Events, Adobe MAX, GitHub Universe, NVIDIA GTC, Google I/O, Nothing, Figma Config, Vercel and Linear, while remaining 100% original and establishing TECHCON\'s own visual language.\n\nThe website must be fully responsive, mobile-first, tablet optimized, desktop optimized, SEO optimized, and production-ready.\n\nIMPORTANT\n\nI have attached the official TECHCON \'26 logo, logo guideline boards, logo concepts, color palettes, typography, and brand identity.\n\nCarefully analyze every attached image before designing anything.\n\nStudy and extract from the brand identity:\n\nLogo proportions\nCurves\nShapes\nCorner radius\nVisual rhythm\nTypography style\nCircuit line language\nOpen book symbolism\nLetter T concept\nLetter C concept\nNetwork connectivity concept\nColor palette\nGradient language\nWhite space usage\nMinimalism\nAbstract futuristic style\n\nThe entire UI must evolve naturally from these assets.\n\nNever redesign the logo. Never distort it. Never recreate it. Never invent another style.\n\nEverything must feel like it belongs to the TECHCON identity.\n\nEVENT DETAILS\n\nEvent Name\n\nTECHCON \'26\n\nTagline\n\nDefining the Future\n\nOrganizer\n\nmsf TechFed\n\n(always write msf in lowercase)\n\nDate\n\n15 July 2026\n\nVenue\n\nCUSAT, Kochi, Kerala, India\n\nDESIGN PHILOSOPHY\n\nThe website should feel like entering the future.\n\nMinimal.\n\nElegant.\n\nClean.\n\nPremium.\n\nTechnology driven.\n\nImmersive.\n\nInteractive.\n\nEvery page should breathe.\n\nNothing should feel crowded.\n\nNo unnecessary decorations.\n\nEvery animation should have a purpose.\n\nVISUAL STYLE\n\nPure White background.\n\nVery soft grey overlays.\n\nGlass morphism.\n\nFloating gradients.\n\nSoft shadows.\n\nAmbient lighting.\n\nBlurred light blobs.\n\nNeural particles.\n\nCircuit traces.\n\nGradient reflections.\n\nVery subtle hexagonal patterns inspired by technology.\n\nEverything should remain minimal.\n\nVERY IMPORTANT BACKGROUND ANIMATIONS\n\nThe background should never remain static.\n\nInspired by the circuit lines in the TECHCON logo and concept board.\n\nAcross the entire website create extremely subtle animated background layers.\n\nThese should include\n\n\342\200\242 Ultra-thin circuit traces\n\n\342\200\242 Network paths\n\n\342\200\242 Connection nodes\n\n\342\200\242 Small glowing dots\n\n\342\200\242 Floating particles\n\n\342\200\242 Neural graph lines\n\n\342\200\242 Digital pulses\n\n\342\200\242 Soft gradient waves\n\n\342\200\242 Slow moving light streaks\n\n\342\200\242 Transparent geometric abstractions\n\nThese animations should stay between 3% and 10% opacity.\n\nThey should never distract the content.\n\nInstead they should create the feeling that technology is quietly flowing behind the interface.\n\nSome circuit paths should slowly draw themselves continuously.\n\nSome nodes should emit tiny pulses every few seconds.\n\nGradient light should slowly move across the page.\n\nVery slow parallax movement while scrolling.\n\nEverything should feel alive without being noticeable.\n\nThe user should feel movement more than actually see it.\n\nMICRO INTERACTIONS\n\nEvery element should respond.\n\nButtons\n\nCards\n\nIcons\n\nInputs\n\nImages\n\nTimeline\n\nNavigation\n\nLogo\n\nEverything.\n\nHover animations.\n\nGlow.\n\nScale.\n\nTilt.\n\nDepth.\n\nRipple.\n\nMagnetic buttons.\n\nCursor effects.\n\nSoft bounce.\n\nElegant easing.\n\nLOADING EXPERIENCE\n\nBefore the website appears\n\nShow an immersive loading animation.\n\nTECHCON logo slowly assembles.\n\nCircuit lines connect.\n\nParticles gather.\n\nGradient lights sweep.\n\nThen smoothly transition into homepage.\n\nCUSTOM CURSOR\n\nReplace default cursor.\n\nSmall glowing gradient orb.\n\nTrailing particles.\n\nHover over buttons\n\nCursor expands.\n\nHover over logo\n\nGradient pulse.\n\nHover over cards\n\nSoft glow.\n\nHERO SECTION\n\nFull viewport.\n\nWhite futuristic environment.\n\nVery soft floating gradients.\n\nAnimated circuit background.\n\nFloating logo.\n\nLarge typography.\n\nDEFINING\nTHE\nFUTURE\n\nShort introduction.\n\nDate.\n\nVenue.\n\nOrganizer.\n\nCountdown timer.\n\nPrimary Button\n\nREGISTER NOW\n\nSecondary Button\n\nEXPLORE EVENT\n\nThe logo should slowly float.\n\nGradient lighting behind it.\n\nCircuit traces occasionally animate outward from the logo exactly like the logo concept board.\n\nHERO ANIMATION\n\nBehind the logo\n\nSoft glowing abstract layers.\n\nMoving light.\n\nFloating particles.\n\nNetwork nodes.\n\nCircuit animations.\n\nEverything inspired directly from the logo.\n\nNo stock illustrations.\n\nNo random graphics.\n\nEverything should originate from the TECHCON brand language.\n\nNAVIGATION\n\nGlass navigation.\n\nSticky.\n\nTransparent initially.\n\nBlur after scrolling.\n\nSmooth transitions.\n\nDesktop\n\nLogo\n\nMenu\n\nRegister Button\n\nMobile\n\nAnimated futuristic menu.\n\nABOUT TECHCON\n\nPremium editorial layout.\n\nLarge typography.\n\nBeautiful spacing.\n\nMission.\n\nVision.\n\nInnovation.\n\nTechnology.\n\nCollaboration.\n\nFuture.\n\nABOUT msf TechFed\n\nProfessional introduction.\n\nTechnology initiatives.\n\nInnovation ecosystem.\n\nYouth empowerment.\n\nFuture technology.\n\nMinimal layout.\n\nWHY ATTEND\n\nInteractive feature cards.\n\nArtificial Intelligence\n\nCyber Security\n\nInnovation\n\nRobotics\n\nNetworking\n\nEngineering\n\nResearch\n\nFuture Careers\n\nEach card should react individually.\n\nGradient glow.\n\nLift effect.\n\nAnimated icon.\n\nEXPERIENCE TIMELINE\n\nBeautiful animated timeline.\n\nCards appear while scrolling.\n\nTimeline line animates.\n\nNodes glow.\n\nSmooth transitions.\n\nVENUE\n\nCUSAT\n\nKochi\n\nInteractive Google Map.\n\nDirections button.\n\nOpen Google Maps.\n\nNearby Metro.\n\nAirport.\n\nTravel Information.\n\nGOOGLE CALENDAR\n\nAdd to Google Calendar button.\n\nOne click.\n\nAutomatically creates official calendar event.\n\nREGISTRATION\n\nThis must feel premium.\n\nNot like a Google Form.\n\nMulti-step animated form.\n\nCollect\n\nFull Name\n\nMobile Number\n\nWhatsApp Number\n\nEmail\n\nAge\n\nGender\n\nDistrict\n\nState\n\nCountry\n\nOccupation\n\nStudent\n\nWorking Professional\n\nEntrepreneur\n\nFaculty\n\nResearch Scholar\n\nOther\n\nIf Student\n\nInstitution\n\nCourse\n\nDepartment\n\nYear\n\nIf Working\n\nCompany\n\nProfession\n\nIndustry\n\nTechnology Interests\n\nAI\n\nML\n\nCyber Security\n\nCloud\n\nIoT\n\nRobotics\n\nWeb\n\nMobile\n\nElectronics\n\nBlockchain\n\nData Science\n\nAR\n\nVR\n\nOther\n\nEmergency Contact\n\nFood Preference\n\nAccessibility Requirement\n\nConsent\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nPrevent duplicate registrations using email and mobile number.\n\nREGISTRATION SUCCESS\n\nAfter successful registration\n\nGenerate an official TECHCON Entry Pass.\n\nPremium glass ticket.\n\nGradient border.\n\nRounded corners.\n\nLooks like Apple Wallet meets airline boarding pass.\n\nInclude\n\nTECHCON Logo\n\nAttendee Name\n\nRegistration ID\n\nQR Code\n\nVenue\n\nDate\n\nOrganizer\n\nCategory\n\nButtons\n\nDownload PDF\n\nDownload PNG\n\nShare to WhatsApp\n\nShare Image\n\nQR CODE\n\nQR should securely contain\n\nRegistration ID\n\nName\n\nPhone\n\nEmail\n\nVerification Token\n\nScanning the QR opens attendance verification.\n\nMark attendance instantly.\n\nPrevent duplicate check-ins.\n\nADMIN DASHBOARD\n\nSecure login.\n\nDashboard includes\n\nTotal Registrations\n\nToday\'s Registrations\n\nAttendance\n\nAnalytics\n\nDistrict Reports\n\nOccupation Reports\n\nGender Reports\n\nQR Scanner\n\nManual Check-in\n\nExport Excel\n\nExport CSV\n\nExport PDF\n\nResend Ticket\n\nEmail\n\nWhatsApp\n\nVolunteer Mode\n\nFOOTER\n\nBeautiful minimal footer.\n\nAnimated circuit divider.\n\nGradient glow.\n\nNewsletter.\n\nQuick Links.\n\nContact.\n\nSocial Media.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY\n\nUse typography that closely matches the TECHCON logo.\n\nRounded geometric futuristic style.\n\nLarge spacing.\n\nElegant.\n\nPremium.\n\nCOLOR SYSTEM\n\nStrictly follow the supplied brand palette.\n\nPrimary\n\nPink\n\nPurple\n\nBlue\n\nSecondary\n\nWhite\n\nDeep Navy\n\nGraphite\n\nUse gradients exactly as provided in the brand guideline.\n\nPERFORMANCE\n\nEverything should remain lightweight.\n\n60 FPS animations.\n\nNo lag.\n\nOptimized images.\n\nLazy loading.\n\nSmooth scrolling.\n\nTECHNOLOGY STACK\n\nReact\n\nVite\n\nTypeScript\n\nTailwind CSS\n\nShadCN UI\n\nGSAP\n\nFramer Motion\n\nLenis\n\nThree.js (minimal)\n\nReact Three Fiber\n\nLottie\n\nFirebase Authentication\n\nFirestore\n\nFirebase Storage\n\nFirebase Hosting\n\nCloud Functions\n\nGoogle Maps API\n\nGoogle Calendar API\n\nQR Generator\n\nPDF Generator\n\nWhatsApp Sharing\n\nANIMATION STYLE\n\nAnimation must be elegant and premium.\n\nNo flashy effects.\n\nNo excessive motion.\n\nEverything should feel like Apple\'s product pages mixed with futuristic digital architecture.\n\nMotion should communicate intelligence.\n\nAnimations should feel almost invisible, yet make the website feel alive.\n\nFINAL GOAL\n\nWhen someone visits the website, they should immediately feel that they are entering the official digital experience of TECHCON \'26, not just another event website. Every pixel should reflect the identity established by the logo and brand guidelines. The abstract forms, circuit-line language, open-book symbolism, gradients, typography, and minimal aesthetic must remain consistent throughout the experience. Background circuit animations should flow subtly at very low opacity, with glowing nodes, digital pulses, floating particles, and soft light beams creating depth without distracting from the content. The website should be clean, immersive, interactive, memorable, and technically polished, making visitors feel that they are stepping into the future of technology before they even arrive at the conference."
    items {
