    modified_response: "I will create `/src/components/Loader.tsx`. This component animates the official TECHCON \'26 branding. It features custom SVG paths representing the ribbon-like letter \"T\" logo as they slowly draw themselves, interactive network nodes that gather in the center, and a progress counter. Once completed, it triggers a smooth fade transition to unlock the main website."
