  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Hero**\n\nOkay, I\'m currently defining the Hero section\'s visual aspects. I\'m focusing on the full viewport layout, envisioning a white, futuristic environment with soft, floating gradients. I plan to use the animated circuit background and add a floating logo with large typography that reads: DEFINING THE.\n\n\n**Designing the Hero**\n\nI\'m now designing the Hero section\'s `/src/components/Hero.tsx`. I\'m going to create a magnificent SVG for the floating logo, with framer-motion for smooth floating transitions. Surrounding it will be animated circuit lines and drifting gradient light blobs. The component will include a short introduction, event details (date, venue, organizer), a countdown timer with JetBrains Mono, and \'REGISTER NOW\' and \'EXPLORE EVENT\' buttons.\n\n\n"
