ting accessibility and professional UX standards.\n*   **Expanded Visual Elements**:\n    *   Densely packed sections with high-fidelity technical badges (e.g., `SYSTEM_ID // 01`, `LATENCY_GPS`, `NODES: DECENTRALIZED_NETWORKS`).\n    *   Integrated responsive icons for academic submissions, networking mixers, and developer workshops.\n"
