, UG, PG, Diploma, Proffesional courses or others. if they selected UG or PG of PRoffesional courses ask a colum which course. \n\nandin worling proffesional just ask job title and institution name. if entrprenure jut ask company name and sector. they are not mandatory. but selecting role is mandatory.\n\n\nan dif researcher ask univrsity, and deparment. and in other noneed any thing to ask. \n\nand in that area itself uder just ask technology interestes. simple not mandatory. an dno need  stage 3 in registration . in stage 2 itself can submit. on submit generate ticket.  and in tcket no need board sector. in the ticke t nee dtechonlogo horizntal on top.  ticket shoul dbe whit ethe,em. in that our gradients.  etc.. ticket shoul dbe i entry ticket shape exactly in that shape. and can  be downloaded inthat sam e shape. and need only save button (no save png etc..) just save. and share to whatsapp. whatsapp icon. \n\nremove important fo pass passngers section. jus give there a note.\njust keep this entry pass on the program entry or event entry  / just giv ethat message. and onhit registration show th ereg id. it should be genrated by th ebackend . it should be ueque. Simple. start from this TC26A001. no need after A999 then B001 then after b999 then C001 . lik etat. and show that registatin number on top under registration complted. an dalso inthe ticket als it should give  inthe wit helevence under the name of person. \nand also need to show participants phone number in the entry pass. \n\nan dn need to give console in header.  and mak eall more creative. and all dat ashould be saved in a google shee that  i give. using google ap script we can do it. so give me code for app script. shold be very secureun hackable . datas are important. and exactly deny th eduplicat e applications. if a mobile number entered an dif that mobil enumebr is already in our data base autoomaticaly auto fil all datas there and desable submit button. and tell th emobile number is lready conect ed with a person. try another phon enumber. \n\nan dgive me the appscript. and after that i wil give you deployed URL an dalso we can control th eadmin contrlpassword inside of the appscript. other wise the websit ewill be hacked. \n\nand nth eadmin pannel make it white theme an dmak ethere dash boards live .total registration  number , gender wise, category wise, and attended, not attended, no need categorisation hobby wise. and need complete data table. also need export to pdf an dexport to execll buttons etc.. and refresh button on top."
    items {
      text: "make techon and 26 same font size.\n\nan dremove \"TECHCON \'26 is more than a series of presentations; it is a collective sandbox designed to spark action. We are assembling creators to establish the rulebook of a highly connected digital tomorrow.\"\n\n\342\200\224 Central Organizing Board, msf TechFed\nParticipants will engage with deep-dive technical folds covering distributed high-scale structures, embedded robotics telemetry, neural computing compilers, and zero-trust cryptography. portion\n\nan dno need brandkit dentity.\n\nCTO-Level Mentorship\nPairing young collegiate innovators with veteran technology leaders and enterprise architects no need this point. \n\nadd yoth an dstudents tech eco system.\nits the wing of msf Kerala State Committee.\n\nremove it - LATENCY: ZERO_LAG_TRANSMISSIONS\nNODES: DECENTRALIZED_NETWORKS\nCORES: QUANTUM_COMPUTATIONAL_UNITS\n\n\nremove syllabus an dgive there the sessions. \n\nSESSION 1 : AI Summit - Smart village assistant with ai minster \nSESSION 2 :General discussion world tech industry and growth + Ai camera work shop for students\nSESSION 3 : Linkedin + placement \nSESSION 4 : Hackathon and worshop for collage students\n\nPRO NIGHT and Closing ceremony\342\200\231s \n\nextra : exhibition & fun games\n\nand make venue CUSAT, Kochi. mak ecochi bolded. \n\nandno need to show metro airport railway stay etc.. \n\ninstead of just under mention NEarest metro startion\nNEarest Railway station \n\netc.. and th edistance from there in bracet.\n\nno need campus schematic scheduling. no need it. ther give  collaborain grands place holder. \n\nan dalso give above that the syllabus section but not unth ecurrent style. som eicons and theri simple captions. no need detaild. AI, NEtwork, Cyber security etc.. wit hproper icons.. \n\nan dmak ethe headings in Jura Bold Font\n\n\nan di nregistration profile ask Place too\nin student section just ask institution and Level. in level need Primary, Highschool, Higher secondary, UG, PG, Diploma, Proffesional courses or others. if they selected UG or PG of PRoffesional courses ask a colum which course. \n\nandin worling proffesional just ask job title and institution name. if entrprenure jut ask company name and sector. they are not mandatory. but selecting role is mandatory.\n\n\nan dif researcher ask univrsity, and deparment. and in other noneed any thing to ask. \n\nand in that area itself uder just ask technology interestes. simple not mandatory. an dno need  stage 3 in registration . in stage 2 itself can submit. on submit generate ticket.  and in tcket no need board sector. in the ticke t nee dtechonlogo horizntal on top.  ticket shoul dbe whit ethe,em. in that our gradients.  etc.. ticket shoul dbe i entry ticket shape exactly in that shape. and can  be downloaded inthat sam e shape. and need only save button (no save png etc..) just save. and share to whatsapp. whatsapp icon. \n\nremove important fo pass passngers section. jus give there a note.\njust keep this entry pass on the program entry or event entry  / just giv ethat message. and onhit registration show th ereg id. it should be genrated by th ebackend . it should be ueque. Simple. start from this TC26A001. no need after A999 then B001 then after b999 then C001 . lik etat. and show that registatin number on top under registration complted. an dalso inthe ticket als it should give  inthe wit helevence under the name of person. \nand also need to show participants phone number in the entry pass. \n\nan dn need to give console in header.  and mak eall more creative. and all dat ashould be saved in a google shee that  i give. using google ap script we can do it. so give me code for app script. shold be very secureun hackable . datas are important. and exactly deny th eduplicat e applications. if a mobile number entered an dif that mobil enumebr is already in our data base autoomaticaly auto fil all datas there and desable submit button. and tell th emobile number is lready conect ed with a person. try another phon enumber. \n\nan dgive me the appscript. and after that i wil give you deployed URL an dalso we can control th eadmin contrlpassword inside of the appscript. other wise the websit ewill be hacked. \n\nand nth eadmin pannel make it white theme an dmak ethere dash boards live .total registration  number , gender wise, category wise, and attended, not attended, no need categorisation hobby wise. and need complete data table. also need export to pdf an dexport to execll buttons etc.. and refresh button on top."
