    thinking: "**Refining Venue Details**\n\nI\'m currently focused on refactoring the `Venue.tsx` component. The immediate goal is to update the venue name to \"CUSAT, **Kochi**\" with \"Kochi\" bolded. I also plan to remove the Metro, Airport, Railway, and Stay tabs. In their place, I\'ll be implementing clean, concise details directly within the component.\n\n\n**Revising Component Layout**\n\nI\'ve streamlined the `Venue.tsx` component further. My focus has shifted to the layout now. The goal is a clean split: a left column with venue details and key info, and a right column for the \"Collaboration Grounds\" visualizer. I\'m prioritizing concise information display, removing campus schematics, and integrating interactive design for the right-hand visual element. Specifically, I\'m working to replace the original scheduling with the more intuitive \"Collaboration Grounds\" visualizer.\n\n\n"
