  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Addressing the components**\n\nI\'ve been making good progress! I\'ve now modified `index.css`, `Navbar.tsx`, `Hero.tsx`, `About.tsx`, `WhyAttend.tsx`, and `Venue.tsx`. I\'m starting to address the `RegistrationForm.tsx` and the Ticket module.\n\n\n**Defining the new forms**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the `RegistrationForm.tsx` revamp. I\'m focusing on the component breakdown based on user roles, encompassing Student, Working Professional, Entrepreneur, Researcher, and Other. I\'m carefully laying out the input fields to incorporate the new \'Place\' field and specific details for each section. I\'ve also defined the specific fields to be displayed for each section. Also, I\'m working to consolidate the entire process into two stages, abandoning the third stage entirely. I\'m also preparing for the feature to autofill form data if a phone number already exists!\n\n\n**Implementing the Validation**\n\nI\'ve got the RegistrationForm update well underway! I\'ve now crafted the disable-and-inform mechanism for duplicate phone numbers, informing the user. Also, I\'ve designed a Registration ID generator based on the total number of registrations, generating IDs. This utilizes a character-index and number-index to create a mathematically clean sequence, from TC26A001 to TC26Z999. I\'m now thinking about how to store the data and will be looking into that shortly.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 256347610
    }
